("v6810", "scalar", "Population claims need specified measures, comparisons and time horizons. Simultaneous aggregate trends do not identify individual causal effects. Personal testimony does not supply the other spouse’s account. Prescriptions require normative arguments; an analogy between a business and a marriage requires a bridge.")
