("v6886", "scalar", "The Field proposes retaining agency and correction. That is a contestable commitment, not a deduction from the calculations. Flexibility has costs; stable roles can be welcome; disagreement does not automatically imply dismissal. People affected by household decisions, including dependants, may have interests this two-person model does not represent.")
